erms"},"id":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/2/id"}},{"any_terms":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/3/match_terms"},"id":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/3/id"}},{"any_terms":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/4/match_terms"},"id":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/4/id"}}],"minimum_component_groups":5,"required_group_ids":{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/discovery/required_group_ids"}},"contrast_examples":["global glow","bloom everywhere","chromatic aberration","lens ghost orbs","red color grade","전체 사진을 붉게 색 보정해줘.","Apply a red color grade to the entire photograph.","모든 영역에 똑같은 뿌연 glow를 덮어줘.","Cover every region with the same hazy glow.","고대비 가장자리 양쪽에 반대색 색수차를 만들어줘.","Create opposed colored aberration fringes on both sides of high-contrast edges."],"definition":"Very bright highlight boundaries carry a thin localized warm or red-biased halo just outside the exposed edge, while the highlight core and surrounding nonhighlight detail remain sufficiently structured to reject global glow and flare.","paraphrase_examples":[{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/0/match_terms/0"},{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/1/match_terms/0"},{"=exact":"cand_1e110051c2e3593d8ffd042a2a42d937/content/authored_components/components/2/match_terms/0"},"아주 밝은 가장자리 바로 밖에 얇고 따뜻한 번짐이 국소적으로 줄어든다. 밝은 코어와 주변 세부는 읽히며 전역 안개나 유령 광점과 구별된다.","A thin warm halo falls off locally just outside very bright edges. Highlight cores and nearby detail remain readable, distinct from global haze, ghost orbs or paired colored fringes.","아주 밝은 창이나 반사광의 경계 바로 바깥에 얇은 따뜻한 색 테두리가 나타난다. 번짐의 폭과 강도는 가까운 영역에서 줄어들고 화면 전체로 퍼지지 않는다. 밝은 대상 자체의 모양과 근처의 어둡거나 중간 밝기 세부는 유지된다. 렌즈 유령 광점, 넓은 안개, 서로 반대색의 이중 가장자리와 구별되는 하나의 국소 번짐으로 읽힌다.","A thin warm-colored rim appears immediately outside a very bright window or reflection boundary. Its width and strength decrease nearby instead of spreading across the frame. The bright object's core shape and neighboring midtone or dark detail remain readable. The halo stays distinct from ghost orbs, broad veiling haze and opposed colored edge pairs."]}},"effects":{"=exact":"cand_bd89eaf2dc675107a4e4c9f33514b970/effects"},"id":{"=exact":"14241/content/associated_profile_ids/0"},"provenance":[{"sha256":"3f55714b6c492bafc666e5618801c373de894f324aa64bcb26b5aa6f8c7d7187","source":"visual_profile:film_halation_highlight_edge_relation"}],"record_kind":"visual_profile"}
